Error [E0118]: `w` in this pattern would make a new `w`, but `w` already holds a value
  --> pattern_test_reuse_named_variant.jet:19:28
    |
 19 |     same :: shape == .Rect{w, ..}
    |                            ^
 Why: A pattern test introduces the names in its pattern; it does not compare with an existing value
 Fix: Pick a new name to bind (`_` if unused); to compare, test the pattern in an `if` condition and compare the bound name there: `if subject == .Case(found) && found == w`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
